Rac84%2F640%3Fwx_fmt%3Dpng%26from%3Dappmsg", "type": "photo"}], "categories": null, "attachments": null, "extra": {}, "language": null, "summary": "Agent Bucket introduces a new storage model that adds an “ObjectSet” layer between buckets and objects, giving each end‑user a dedicated, isolated storage space. It enables native multi‑tenant isolation, per‑user bandwidth, quota, and lifecycle controls, plus independent domains and fine‑grained permissions. The system supports up to a billion ObjectSets per bucket, with automatic partitioning across clusters via Set Slice, and offers transparent monitoring, billing, and intelligent features. This design simplifies building scalable AI agents and other multi‑tenant services."}, "settings": {}}